<title>USA: Pipestone, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Pipestone, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., said it won $2.300 million of Pipestone, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.82 percent.  </p>
<p>AMT: 2,300,000	DATE: 09/23/96	NYC Time: 1400	CUSIP: 724122</p>
<p>ISSUER: Pipestone							 ST: MN</p>
<p>ISSUE: GO Tax Increment, Series 1996</p>
<p>TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: Baa/NA/NA							 BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: None							BANK QUAL: Y</p>
<p>DTD: 10/01/96							     SURE BID: Y</p>
<p>DUE: 2/1/98-17						SR MGR: Cronin &amp; Co.</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 02/01/97					   DOLLAR BID: NA</p>
<p>CALL: 2/1/05 @ par					  TIC 5.82</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 40 days					   ORDERS: 1.5 HRS</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: To be named by the City</p>
<p>L.O.: Kennedy &amp; Graven, Minneapolis</p>
